  "description": "Revit API extensions library with automatic version detection for Revit 2023-2026.\n\n      This package automatically detects which Revit version you're using based on your RevitAPI.dll reference\n      and provides the appropriate framework target and assembly references without any manual configuration.\n\n      Features:\n      - Automatic Revit version detection (2023-2026)\n      - Automatic framework selection (.NET Framework 4.8.1 for Revit 2023-2024, .NET 8.0 for Revit 2025-2026)\n      - Extension methods for common Revit API operations\n      - Zero configuration required",
